<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you haven&#8217;t checked out my new AI podcast with Chris Bailey, you should.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.relay.fm/intentional/5">On this episode of <em>Intentional AI</em></a>, Chris and I map the dragons waiting at the edge of the AI map: false confidence, scope creep, becoming the donkey, and surrender. Chris tells the story of cooking with ChatGPT after a few drinks and ending up with something his wife spat out, and I talk through what it looks like when a robot starts driving you instead of the other way around.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We also cover Siri AI&#8217;s first genuinely reliable beta in iOS 27, get real hands-on time with Fable, and check in on Chris&#8217;s DIY values test and my cautious first steps into AI-assisted journaling. Sailors used to write &#8220;there be dragons&#8221; at the edge of unmapped territory. This episode is our field guide to the ones we&#8217;ve found so far.</p>



